instructions:
Reads the Cloudflare API through `../cloudflare-api`; CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN needs the Account → Workers R2 Storage: Edit scope.

Instance example:

  // packages/infra/environments/production/inbox-raw.ts
  import { r2Module } from '../../modules/r2'
  export default r2Module.instance({
    name: 'inbox-raw',
    config: { accountId: '<account id>', bucketName: 'myproject-inbox-raw' },
  })

Wire it into a Worker via the cloudflare module:

  imports: [inboxRaw],
  config: { ..., r2Bindings: [{ binding: 'RAW', from: 'inbox-raw', output: 'bucketName' }] }
